local Pfd=Ofd==bb.trainee and Nfd:FindFirstChild(Jfd.what==Lde[2575]and Lde[4468]or Lde[2322])
if Pfd then
Kfd=Kfd+(tonumber(Pfd.Value)or 0)
end
end
bb.trainTk=math.max(bb.trainTk or 0,Kfd)
F.status(Lde[3114],string.format(Lde[4469],V.name(Jfd.id),bb.trainTk,Jfd.what,U.fmt(Jfd.have+(Jfd.got or 0)+bb.trainTk),U.fmt(Jfd.need)))
